From dc305f9b0c24aff130a941b6b4503696dd045ef8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Baryshkov <dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 05:57:54 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno/a5xx: write the linear centroid interpolator regid
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

HLSQ_CONTROL_3_REG was built with IJ_PERSP_CENTROID twice: the second
one carried the *linear* centroid regid, so it was OR'd into the
perspective centroid field while IJ_LINEAR_CENTROID was left at 0 —
which reads as r0.x rather than "unused".

Use the IJ_LINEAR_CENTROID field for the linear centroid regid.

Fixes: 946cf4eb6846 ("freedreno/a5xx: initial support")
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-4-8
Signed-off-by: Dmitry Baryshkov <dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/44343>
---
 src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a5xx/fd5_program.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a5xx/fd5_program.c b/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a5xx/fd5_program.c
index 80eb2b22833c..550756a3468a 100644
--- a/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a5xx/fd5_program.c
+++ b/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a5xx/fd5_program.c
@@ -541,7 +541,7 @@ fd5_program_emit(struct fd_context *ctx, struct fd_ringbuffer *ring,
          A5XX_HLSQ_CONTROL_3_REG_IJ_LINEAR_PIXEL(ij_regid[IJ_LINEAR_PIXEL]) |
          A5XX_HLSQ_CONTROL_3_REG_IJ_PERSP_CENTROID(
             ij_regid[IJ_PERSP_CENTROID]) |
-         A5XX_HLSQ_CONTROL_3_REG_IJ_PERSP_CENTROID(
+         A5XX_HLSQ_CONTROL_3_REG_IJ_LINEAR_CENTROID(
             ij_regid[IJ_LINEAR_CENTROID]));
    OUT_RING(
       ring,
-- 
